  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">着装该护甲时，你的</span><span class=\"1\">AC </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">获得</span><span class=\"1\">+1 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">加值。</span><br style=\"WORD-SPACING:0px;ORPHANS:2;WIDOWS:2;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">这身皮甲共有</span><span class=\"1\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">发充能，并将于每天黎明时恢复[[/r 1d3]]发充能。当你攻击并击中一个失去了任何量生命值的目标时，你可以消耗一发充能，并对该目标额外造成</span><span class=\"1\">[[/r 1d10]]</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">的黯蚀伤害。</span><br style=\"WORD-SPACING:0px;ORPHANS:2;WIDOWS:2;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /></p></div>",
